# Signature-agnostic zones, installed at kPostLoad. One zone per line:
#
#   <id> <category> <name>             Address Library ID for the running game
#   <seId>,<aeId> <category> <name>    or an SE/AE pair; the plugin picks its runtime's
#
# Each line detours the function at that ID and opens a zone (Tracy,
# BasicTelemetry, and the sampler's zone stack) around every call. No signature
# is needed. tools/attribution/analyze.py prints ready-made lines for the
# hottest unscoped functions. Blank lines and text after '#' or ';' are ignored.
#
# Example (already zoned by the built-in hooks, so left commented out):
# 100424,107142  Render  Main::RenderWorld
